{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那么，要买什么呢～”", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "sn1565", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呃，是我要买吧？”", "text_idx": 174, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不管啦总之闭嘴跟我来。你只要负责付钱就好。”", "text_idx": 162, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "sn1566", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“为什么会这样啊……”", "text_idx": 166, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "休业式结束后，我依约定跟纱凪来到商场。", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "目的是买送给美羽学姐的圣诞礼物。", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……应该是这样的，但她看起来完全是打算买自己想要的东西。", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔啊～好想要这个黑猫的抱枕～”", "text_idx": 175, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "sn1567", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这个跟新吾很像对吧？啊，我是说猫咪新吾喔，猫咪。”", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "sn1568", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“先让我确认一下，我们是来买送给美羽学姐的礼物对吧？”", "text_idx": 172, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊呀～这个玩偶也好可爱～黑猫跟白猫，也有一组的……嗯嗯嗯。”", "text_idx": 176, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "sn1569", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不行，她完全被自己的物欲驱使。", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，我也想不出来买什么东西会让学姐高兴。", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "以学姐的个性，不管送她什么都会高兴的吧。", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不过，情侣还真多呢，这个时期……”", "text_idx": 165, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "sn1570", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“毕竟圣诞节快到了。”", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“该不会我们看起来也像情侣？”", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "sn1571", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不管怎么看，都是感情好的同学吧。”", "text_idx": 163, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是那样没错啦。”", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "sn1572", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯～～～～”", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "sn1573", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你在烦恼要买什么吗？”", "text_idx": 171, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“想要那个黑猫和白猫的玩偶。”", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "sn1574", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“给谁？”", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“主要是我。”", "text_idx": 167, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "sn1575", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好，差不多该去下一间店了……”", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一直找不到该送学姐什么礼物。", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "外面天色也暗了，要认真思考才行。", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是说，你自己没有想要送什么东西吗？”", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "sn1576", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这个嘛……戒指之类的？”", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“笨蛋，那个还太早了啦！干脆送塞了一堆糖果的袜子算了！”", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "sn1577", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“又不是小孩子了……”", "text_idx": 173, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“总之，戒指不行。完全不行。”", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "sn1578", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是，可以的话想送能随身携带的东西。”", "text_idx": 170, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，能随身携带吗……”", "text_idx": 181, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "sn1579", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪很不舍地把猫咪玩偶放回架上，环顾卖场。", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，这个票卡夹怎么样？而且毕业后，学姐搭电车的机会应该会变多。”", "text_idx": 178, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "sn1580", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“票卡夹吗……好像不错。还可以放我的照片进去……”", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不行。”", "text_idx": 164, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "sn1581", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“开玩笑的啦，猫咪的设计也很可爱，这个好像很不错。”", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 159, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "sn1582", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那就买那个吧。要请店员包成送礼用的包装喔。”", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "sn1583", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，还有这个白猫和黑猫的玩偶是吧？”", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸……”", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "sn1584", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“感谢你陪我选礼物。”", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“笨、笨蛋！那样做的话，美羽学姐会伤心的吧！”", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "sn1585", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“会吗？如果学姐在这里，她应该会做和我一样的事情吧？”", "text_idx": 169, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 159, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "sn1586", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没关系的，我不会让那个人伤心。”", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……约好了喔。”", "text_idx": 160, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "sn1587", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯。”", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“今天谢谢你，帮了我很大的忙。”", "text_idx": 168, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我也得到想要的玩偶，满足了。”", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "sn1588", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这么多东西拿得动吗？”", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“至今为止，我都抱着像你一样碍事的东西进行社团活动，这点程度不算什么。”", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "sn1589", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那真是失敬了。”", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那我要回家了。新吾跟美羽都肚子饿了在等我吧。”", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "sn1590", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“给它们最美味的猫罐头吧。”", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
